  "scope": "Immutable incarnation-bound native attention in taskbar families, static amber top-edge attention versus blue bottom-edge active state, explicit accessible labels and active aria-current. Actual GTK activation request while inactive yields native urgency without focus theft; physical indicators differ, activation clears urgency and the chosen client receives keys. Application controls now precede utilities after original pixels exposed clipping. Independent native-AT/original acceptance remains open.",
